  <text>
      <body>
         <div type="performance_playbill" rend="align(center)" xml:lang="en">
            <ab><placeName ref="namedentities.xml#covent_garden">Theatre Royal, Covent-Garden</placeName>,<lb/>
               This present <date when="1811-11-05"><hi rend="allcaps">Tuesday</hi>, Nov. 5, 1811</date><lb/>
               Will be acted, <hi rend="italic">second time, (with new Scenes, Dresses &amp; Decorations) Shakspeare's</hi> Play of<lb/>
               <bibl><title ref="namedentities.xml#play_measure_for_measure">Measure for Measure.</title></bibl><lb/>
               <castList>
                  <castItem><role>The Duke of Austria</role> by <actor ref="namedentities.xml#jo_ph_ke">Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Kemble</hi>,</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><role>Angelo</role> by <actor>Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Barrymore</hi>,</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><role>Escalus</role> by <actor ref="namedentities.xml#ch_mu">Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Murray</hi>,</actor></castItem> <castItem><role>Claudio</role> by <actor>Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Brunton</hi>,</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><role>Lucio</role> by <actor>Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Jones</hi>,</actor></castItem> <castItem><role>Frederick</role> by <actor>Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Claremont</hi>,</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><role>Leopold</role> by <actor>Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Hamerton</hi>,</actor></castItem> <castItem><role>Friar Peter</role> by <actor>Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Chapman</hi>,</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><role><hi rend="italic">Gentlemen,</hi></role> Mess. <actor>Brown,</actor> <actor>Grant,</actor> <actor>Heath,</actor> <actor>Louis,</actor> <actor ref="namedentities.xml#mr_pl">Platt,</actor> <actor>Powers,</actor> <actor>Sarjant,</actor> <actor>Yarnold</actor></castItem>
                  <castItem><role>Provost</role> by <actor>Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Creswell</hi>,</actor></castItem> <castItem><role>Froth</role> by <actor ref="namedentities.xml#fr_me">Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Menage</hi>,</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><role>Elbow</role> by <actor ref="namedentities.xml#wi_bl">Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Blanchard</hi>,</actor></castItem> <castItem><role>Pompey</role> by <actor ref="namedentities.xml#jo_li">Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Liston</hi>,</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><role>Abhorson,</role> <actor>Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">King</hi>,</actor></castItem> <castItem><role>Barnadine,</role> <actor ref="namedentities.xml#jo_em">Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Emery</hi>,</actor></castItem> <castItem><role>Thomas,</role> <actor>Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Truman</hi></actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><role>Apparitors,</role> Mess. <actor>Bishop</actor> and <actor>Huckel,</actor></castItem> <castItem><role>Tipstaves,</role> Mess. <actor ref="namedentities.xml#mr_how">Howell</actor> and <actor>Norris,</actor></castItem><lb/><lb/>
                  <castItem><role>Isabella</role> by <actor ref="namedentities.xml#sa_ke_si">Mrs. <hi rend="allcaps">Siddons</hi>,</actor><lb/>
                     <hi rend="italic">(Being the last season of <persName ref="namedentities.xml#sa_ke_si">Mrs. <hi rend="allcaps">Siddons</hi>'s</persName> appearing on the Stage.)</hi></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><role>Mariana</role> by <actor ref="namedentities.xml#ja_po">Mrs. <hi rend="allcaps">Powell</hi>,</actor></castItem> <castItem><role>Francisca</role> by <actor>Mrs. <hi rend="allcaps">Humphries</hi>,</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><role>Mrs. Overdone</role> by <actor ref="namedentities.xml#ma_an_da">Mrs. <hi rend="allcaps">Davenport</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>        
               </castList>
               The Play of <hi rend="italic">Measure for Measure</hi> is printed conformably to the representation, and<lb/>
               will be to be had [<hi rend="italic">only at the Theatre</hi>] this Evening.<lb/>
               To which will be added a Farce called<lb/>
               <bibl><title ref="namedentities.xml#play_all_the_worlds_a_stage"><hi rend="allcaps">All</hi> the <hi rend="allcaps">World</hi>'s a <hi rend="allcaps">Stage</hi></title></bibl><lb/>
               <castList>
                  <castItem><role>Sir Gilbert Pumpkin</role> by <actor ref="namedentities.xml#wi_bl">Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Blanchard</hi>,</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><role>Capt. Stanley,</role> <actor>Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Hamerton</hi>,</actor></castItem> <castItem><role>Capt. Stukely,</role> <actor>Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Claremont</hi>,</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><role>Diggory</role> by <actor ref="namedentities.xml#jo_li">Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Liston</hi>,</actor></castItem> <castItem><role>Cymon,</role> <actor ref="namedentities.xml#sa_si">Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Simmons</hi>,</actor></castItem> <castItem><role>Wat,</role> <actor>Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">King</hi>,</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><role>William</role> by <actor>Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Sarjant</hi>,</actor></castItem> <castItem><role>Ralp,</role> <actor>Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Louis</hi>,</actor></castItem> <castItem><role>Robin,</role> <actor ref="namedentities.xml#mr_pl">Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Platt</hi>,</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><role>Miss Bridget Pumpkin</role> by <actor ref="namedentities.xml#ma_an_da">Mrs. <hi rend="allcaps">Davenport</hi>,</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><role>Kitty Sprightly</role> by <actor ref="namedentities.xml#sa_bo">Miss <hi rend="allcaps">S. Booth</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
               </castList>
               <hi rend="italic">No Orders can be admitted on the Nights of</hi> <persName ref="namedentities.xml#sa_ke_si">Mrs. Siddons's</persName> <hi rend="italic">performance</hi>.<lb/>
               Boxes <measure type="currency">6s</measure>. Second Price <measure type="currency">3s</measure>. Pit <measure type="currency">3s</measure>. <measure type="currency">6d</measure>. Second Price <measure type="currency">2s</measure>. Gallery <measure type="currency">2s</measure>.<lb/>
               Second Price <measure type="currency">1s</measure>. Upper Gallery <measure type="currency">1s</measure>. Second Price <measure type="currency">6d</measure>.<lb/>
               Vivant Rex &amp; Regina.</ab>
         </div>
      </body>
